<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 5.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices- Feb 5.</headline>
<text>
<p>DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST   180 CST	MDO     GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	    92/94     85/87	 UNQ     184/188</p>
<p>SINGAPORE BUNKER 96/97 102/103 185/190 200/205</p>
<p>-------- COMMENTS - Bunker prices continued to ease on Wednesday, tracking cargo prices with enquiries dwindling ahead of the Chinese New Year holidays, traders said. A bunker 380-cst was done at $96 per tonne. Sentiment was expected to remain weak during the Chinese and Moslem holidays over the weekend.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3571)</p>
